<title>USA: Slovenia to seek 35,000-40,000T US HRW wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Slovenia to seek 35,000-40,000T US HRW wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia was expected to tender early next week for 35,000 to 40,000 tonnes U.S. hard red spring wheat, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for October 12-November 15.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
